IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BOPSSTALE.

*> Advisory lock inspection (GATE 4).  Locks come from BLCK and have an
*> expiry instant (BLCK reclaims them on contention).  This program only
*> LISTS and explicitly RELEASES expired entries.  A fresh lock is NEVER
*> removed: stale detection is not automatic deletion.  Release requires
*> a reason and is audited.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT LCK-FILE ASSIGN TO WS-LCK-PATH
        ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
        ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
        RECORD KEY IS LK-NAME OF LCK-REC
        FILE STATUS IS WS-LCK-ST.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD LCK-FILE.
01 LCK-REC.
   05 LK-NAME PIC X(24).
   05 LK-OWNER PIC X(16).
   05 LK-DATE PIC 9(08).
   05 LK-SECS PIC 9(05).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-LCK-PATH PIC X(200).
01 WS-HOME PIC X(80).
01 WS-LCK-ST PIC X(02).
01 WS-NAME PIC X(24).
01 WS-NOW PIC X(14).
01 WS-TODAY PIC 9(08).
01 WS-NOWSEC PIC 9(05).
01 WS-EXP PIC 9(05).
01 WS-EOF PIC X(01).
01 WS-STALE-FLAG PIC X(05).
01 WS-DATA-DIR PIC X(80).
01 WS-REG-NAME PIC X(64) VALUE "REGISTRY-LOCKIDX".
01 WS-KF-MODE PIC X(01).
01 WS-KF-STATUS PIC X(02).
COPY "BKAUDP".

LINKAGE SECTION.
COPY "BKLOCKP".

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BK-LOCK-PARMS.
    MOVE "00" TO LK-RC
    MOVE SPACES TO LK-MSG
    ACCEPT WS-HOME FROM ENVIRONMENT "BANK_HOME"
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-DATA-DIR
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/var/data"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-DATA-DIR
    END-STRING
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-LCK-PATH
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/var/data/lock.idx"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-LCK-PATH
    *> serialise against BLCK's check-and-set on the same ISAM file
    MOVE "W" TO WS-KF-MODE
    CALL "KFLOCK" USING WS-KF-MODE WS-DATA-DIR WS-REG-NAME
        WS-KF-STATUS
    IF WS-KF-STATUS NOT = "00"
        MOVE WS-KF-STATUS TO LK-RC
        MOVE "LOCK REGISTRY UNAVAILABLE" TO LK-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    OPEN I-O LCK-FILE
    IF WS-LCK-ST = "35"
        CLOSE LCK-FILE
        PERFORM REG-RELEASE
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF WS-LCK-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE WS-LCK-ST TO LK-RC
        MOVE "CANNOT OPEN LOCK STORE" TO LK-MSG
        PERFORM REG-RELEASE
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-NOW
    MOVE WS-NOW(1:8) TO WS-TODAY
    COMPUTE WS-NOWSEC = FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-NOW(9:2)) * 3600
        + FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-NOW(11:2)) * 60
        + FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-NOW(13:2))
    EVALUATE FUNCTION TRIM(LK-OP)
        WHEN "LIST" PERFORM DO-LIST
        WHEN "RELEASE" PERFORM DO-RELEASE
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE "99" TO LK-RC
            MOVE "UNKNOWN LOCK OP" TO LK-MSG
    END-EVALUATE
    CLOSE LCK-FILE
    PERFORM REG-RELEASE
    GOBACK.

REG-RELEASE.
    MOVE "R" TO WS-KF-MODE
    CALL "KFLOCK" USING WS-KF-MODE WS-DATA-DIR WS-REG-NAME
        WS-KF-STATUS.

DO-LIST.
    MOVE "N" TO WS-EOF
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = "Y"
        READ LCK-FILE NEXT RECORD
            AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF
            NOT AT END
                PERFORM MARK-STALE
                DISPLAY "LOCK " FUNCTION TRIM(LK-NAME OF LCK-REC)
                    " owner=" FUNCTION TRIM(LK-OWNER OF LCK-REC)
                    " " WS-STALE-FLAG
        END-READ
    END-PERFORM.

DO-RELEASE.
    IF LK-REASON(1:4) = SPACES
        MOVE "20" TO LK-RC
        MOVE "RELEASE REQUIRES A REASON" TO LK-MSG
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE LK-NAME-IN TO WS-NAME
    MOVE WS-NAME TO LK-NAME OF LCK-REC
    READ LCK-FILE
        INVALID KEY
            MOVE "22" TO LK-RC
            MOVE "LOCK NOT FOUND" TO LK-MSG
        NOT INVALID KEY
            PERFORM MARK-STALE
            IF WS-STALE-FLAG = "FRESH"
                MOVE "20" TO LK-RC
                MOVE "LOCK NOT EXPIRED - REFUSING RELEASE"
                    TO LK-MSG
            ELSE
                DELETE LCK-FILE RECORD
                IF WS-LCK-ST NOT = "00"
                    MOVE WS-LCK-ST TO LK-RC
                    MOVE "LOCK DELETE FAILED" TO LK-MSG
                ELSE
                    MOVE "LOCK RELEASED" TO LK-MSG
                    PERFORM AUDIT-REL
                END-IF
            END-IF
    END-READ.

MARK-STALE.
    MOVE "FRESH" TO WS-STALE-FLAG
    MOVE LK-SECS OF LCK-REC TO WS-EXP
    IF LK-DATE OF LCK-REC < WS-TODAY OR WS-EXP < WS-NOWSEC
        MOVE "STALE" TO WS-STALE-FLAG
    END-IF.

AUDIT-REL.
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-AUD-PARMS
    MOVE LK-OPERATOR TO BK-AUD-OPERATOR
    MOVE "LOCK.RELEASE" TO BK-AUD-ACTION
    MOVE "LOCK" TO BK-AUD-ENTITY
    MOVE LK-CORR TO BK-AUD-CORR
    MOVE LK-NAME-IN TO BK-AUD-BEFORE
    MOVE LK-REASON TO BK-AUD-AFTER
    MOVE LK-RC TO BK-AUD-RESULT
    CALL "BAUD" USING BK-AUD-PARMS.
